  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 22d0308a90dc49ae97395f1b651723b5, type: 3}
  m_Name: Q_TECH_03_SiemFit
  questionId: TECH-03
  category: 1
  speakerName: Principal Security Architect
  questionText: >-
    An architect says their SIEM already correlates identity, endpoint, and cloud telemetry. Where does your solution fit?
  answerOptions:
  - {fileID: 11400001}
  - {fileID: 11400002}
  - {fileID: 11400003}
  - {fileID: 11400004}
--- !u!114 &11400001
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0d521c6b84db4b8fae30e3785d9e9582, type: 3}
  m_Name: Q_TECH_03_A1
  answerText: >-
    Ask where correlation still fails operationally, then position around coverage gaps and response workflow.
  technicalDelta: 3
  commercialDelta: 1
  rapportDelta: 1
  energyDelta: -1
--- !u!114 &11400002
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0d521c6b84db4b8fae30e3785d9e9582, type: 3}
  m_Name: Q_TECH_03_A2
  answerText: >-
    Argue that SIEMs are legacy and should be displaced.
  technicalDelta: 1
  commercialDelta: 1
  rapportDelta: -2
  energyDelta: -1
--- !u!114 &11400003
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0d521c6b84db4b8fae30e3785d9e9582, type: 3}
  m_Name: Q_TECH_03_A3
  answerText: >-
    Describe every integration available and let them decide what matters.
  technicalDelta: 2
  commercialDelta: -1
  rapportDelta: 0
  energyDelta: -1
--- !u!114 &11400004
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0d521c6b84db4b8fae30e3785d9e9582, type: 3}
  m_Name: Q_TECH_03_A4
  answerText: >-
    Position it as a board-level dashboard rather than a technical control.
  technicalDelta: -1
  commercialDelta: 2
  rapportDelta: 1
  energyDelta: 1
